# DS Multiple Disease Prediction

This project predicts **Diabetes**, **Heart Disease**, and **Parkinsons Disease** using Machine Learning.

## Datasets
- Diabetes: 768 rows × 9 columns
- Heart Disease: 920 rows × 16 columns
- Parkinsons: 195 rows × 24 columns

## Steps
1. Data Loading
2. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
3. Data Cleaning & Preparation
4. Feature Selection
5. Machine Learning Models (Random Forest)
6. Evaluation (Accuracy & Confusion Matrix)

## Results
- Diabetes Accuracy:0.7207792207792207 
- Heart Disease Accuracy: 0.842391304347826
- Parkinsons Accuracy: 0.9487179487179487 